## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

This arm makes the original cardamom–bergamot ignition and lavender–cedar vertical more transparent without turning La Nuit into weak generic freshness. Literal cedar, Cashmeran textile shadow, vetiver, and dry tonka remain audible beneath the molecular air. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LN-02.json`.

